# Raw runtime traces are preserved on the experiment host but intentionally
# excluded from normal Git history. Structured response/evidence JSON is also
# kept local; the public repository tracks source code and Markdown reports.
fault20_fast_validation/reports/*.jsonl
fault20_fast_validation/reports/*.txt
fault20_fast_validation/reports/*.json
fault20_fast_validation/reports/**/*.json

# The public package intentionally keeps only the final runtime, adapter and
